# Terraform/OpenTofu PostgreSQL Backend
# Copy to .env and set actual values
# By name, not IP: the postgres cert (hosts/database) is a step-ca leaf for
# database.homelab.local and verify-full checks the hostname against it.
# The machine running tofu must trust step-ca (modules/step-ca-trust.nix or
# the workstation equivalent); otherwise append &sslrootcert=<path to root>.
PG_CONN_STR="postgres://terraform:PASSWORD@database.homelab.internal:5432/terraform?sslmode=verify-full"
